<title>DENMARK: Hypotekbanken raises 4 pct bond by 26 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Hypotekbanken raises 4 pct bond by 26 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Hypotekbanken said on Tuesday that it was increasing the amount of an existing four percent bond by 26 million crowns, to 426 million.</p>
<p>A statement by the bank added that the bonds, maturing in 2,000, were already fully sold.</p>
<p>--Ole Mikkelsen, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 969654</p>
</text>
